{"seq":3,"slug":"directory-conventions","title":"目录约定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/directory-conventions","wordCount":552,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"目录约定\">目录约定</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>目录结构是代码库的&quot;建筑蓝图&quot;。一个清晰、一致的目录约定能够让团队成员在不阅读一行代码的情况下，就能理解项目的模块划分、功能边界和依赖方向。它是团队协作中最基础的&quot;无声契约&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    STRUCTURE[目录约定]&#10;    STRUCTURE --&gt; DISCOVER[可发现性&lt;br/&gt;快速定位代码位置]&#10;    STRUCTURE --&gt; MAINTAIN[可维护性&lt;br/&gt;清晰的模块边界]&#10;    STRUCTURE --&gt; SCALE[可扩展性&lt;br/&gt;新功能有章可循]&#10;    STRUCTURE --&gt; AUTO[自动化友好&lt;br/&gt;工具可按路径约定运行]\">graph TD\n    STRUCTURE[目录约定]\n    STRUCTURE --&gt; DISCOVER[可发现性&lt;br/&gt;快速定位代码位置]\n    STRUCTURE --&gt; MAINTAIN[可维护性&lt;br/&gt;清晰的模块边界]\n    STRUCTURE --&gt; SCALE[可扩展性&lt;br/&gt;新功能有章可循]\n    STRUCTURE --&gt; AUTO[自动化友好&lt;br/&gt;工具可按路径约定运行]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"应用层目录结构\">应用层目录结构</h2><h3 id=\"feature-based-结构-推荐\">Feature-Based 结构（推荐）</h3><p>Feature-Based 目录结构以业务功能为维度组织代码，每个 feature 目录内包含该功能所需的所有文件——组件、hooks、工具函数、类型定义、测试等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/&#10;├── app/                          # 应用入口与路由配置&#10;│   ├── layout.tsx&#10;│   ├── page.tsx&#10;│   └── providers.tsx&#10;├── features/                     # 业务功能模块&#10;│   ├── auth/&#10;│   │   ├── components/&#10;│   │   │   ├── LoginForm.tsx&#10;│   │   │   └── SignupForm.tsx&#10;│   │   ├── hooks/&#10;│   │   │   └── useAuth.ts&#10;│   │   ├── services/&#10;│   │   │   └── authApi.ts&#10;│   │   ├── types/&#10;│   │   │   └── auth.ts&#10;│   │   └── index.ts              # 公开 API（barrel file）&#10;│   ├── dashboard/&#10;│   │   ├── components/&#10;│   │   ├── hooks/&#10;│   │   ├── services/&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   └── settings/&#10;│       ├── components/&#10;│       ├── hooks/&#10;│       └── index.ts&#10;├── shared/                       # 跨功能共享代码&#10;│   ├── components/               # 通用 UI 组件&#10;│   │   ├── Button.tsx&#10;│   │   ├── Modal.tsx&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   ├── hooks/                    # 通用 hooks&#10;│   │   ├── useDebounce.ts&#10;│   │   └── useLocalStorage.ts&#10;│   ├── lib/                      # 第三方库封装&#10;│   │   ├── axios.ts&#10;│   │   └── dayjs.ts&#10;│   ├── types/                    # 全局类型定义&#10;│   │   └── global.d.ts&#10;│   └── utils/                    # 工具函数&#10;│       ├── format.ts&#10;│       └── validation.ts&#10;└── styles/                       # 全局样式&#10;    ├── globals.css&#10;    └── variables.css\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── app/                          # 应用入口与路由配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── layout.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── providers.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── features/                     # 业务功能模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── auth/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   ├── LoginForm.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── SignupForm.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── hooks/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── useAuth.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── services/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── authApi.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── types/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── auth.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts              # 公开 API（barrel file）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── dashboard/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── hooks/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── services/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── settings/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── hooks/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── shared/                       # 跨功能共享代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── components/               # 通用 UI 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── Button.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── Modal.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── hooks/                    # 通用 hooks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── useDebounce.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── useLocalStorage.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── lib/                      # 第三方库封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── axios.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── dayjs.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── types/                    # 全局类型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── global.d.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── utils/                    # 工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── format.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── validation.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── styles/                       # 全局样式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── globals.css</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── variables.css</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"依赖方向规则\">依赖方向规则</h3><p>Feature-Based 结构的核心约束是依赖方向：features 之间不能直接互相引用，只能通过 shared 层共享代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    AUTH[features/auth]&#10;    DASH[features/dashboard]&#10;    SETTINGS[features/settings]&#10;    SHARED[shared/]&#10;&#10;    AUTH --&gt; SHARED&#10;    DASH --&gt; SHARED&#10;    SETTINGS --&gt; SHARED&#10;    AUTH -.-&gt;|禁止| DASH&#10;    DASH -.-&gt;|禁止| SETTINGS\">graph TD\n    AUTH[features/auth]\n    DASH[features/dashboard]\n    SETTINGS[features/settings]\n    SHARED[shared/]\n\n    AUTH --&gt; SHARED\n    DASH --&gt; SHARED\n    SETTINGS --&gt; SHARED\n    AUTH -.-&gt;|禁止| DASH\n    DASH -.-&gt;|禁止| SETTINGS</pre><p>可以通过 ESLint 的 <code>import/no-restricted-paths</code> 规则强制这一约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// eslint.config.js&#10;import restrictedPaths from &#39;eslint-plugin-import/rules/no-restricted-paths&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default [&#10;  {&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;import/no-restricted-paths&#39;: [&#10;        &#39;error&#39;,&#10;        {&#10;          zones: [&#10;            {&#10;              target: &#39;./src/features/auth&#39;,&#10;              from: &#39;./src/features/dashboard&#39;,&#10;            },&#10;            {&#10;              target: &#39;./src/features/dashboard&#39;,&#10;              from: &#39;./src/features/auth&#39;,&#10;            },&#10;          ],&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// eslint.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restrictedPaths </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-plugin-import/rules/no-restricted-paths'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'import/no-restricted-paths'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          zones: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/features/auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/features/dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/features/dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/features/auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"barrel-file-模式\">Barrel File 模式</h2><p>Barrel File（<code>index.ts</code>）是每个模块的&quot;公开 API&quot;。它明确声明了哪些内容可以被外部使用，隐藏了内部实现细节。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// features/auth/index.ts&#10;export { LoginForm } from &#39;./components/LoginForm&#39;;&#10;export { SignupForm } from &#39;./components/SignupForm&#39;;&#10;export { useAuth } from &#39;./hooks/useAuth&#39;;&#10;export type { User, AuthState } from &#39;./types/auth&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// features/auth/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { LoginForm } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './components/LoginForm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { SignupForm } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './components/SignupForm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useAuth } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './hooks/useAuth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { User, AuthState } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './types/auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>外部代码只通过 barrel file 访问功能模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// features/dashboard/components/Header.tsx&#10;import { useAuth } from &#39;@/features/auth&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// features/dashboard/components/Header.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useAuth } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/features/auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"组件文件组织\">组件文件组织</h2><h3 id=\"单文件组件\">单文件组件</h3><p>对于简单组件，单个文件足矣：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"components/&#10;└── Button.tsx\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Button.tsx</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"组件目录\">组件目录</h3><p>对于复杂组件，使用目录组织关联文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"components/&#10;└── DataTable/&#10;    ├── DataTable.tsx            # 主组件&#10;    ├── DataTableHeader.tsx      # 子组件&#10;    ├── DataTableRow.tsx         # 子组件&#10;    ├── DataTable.test.tsx       # 测试&#10;    ├── DataTable.stories.tsx    # Storybook&#10;    ├── useDataTable.ts          # 组件专用 hook&#10;    └── index.ts                 # 导出\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── DataTable/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── DataTable.tsx            # 主组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── DataTableHeader.tsx      # 子组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── DataTableRow.tsx         # 子组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── DataTable.test.tsx       # 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── DataTable.stories.tsx    # Storybook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── useDataTable.ts          # 组件专用 hook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── index.ts                 # 导出</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名约定\">命名约定</h2><p>一致的命名约定减少认知负担，让代码库更加可预测。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>约定</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>React 组件</td>\n<td>PascalCase</td>\n<td><code>UserProfile.tsx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hooks</td>\n<td>camelCase + use 前缀</td>\n<td><code>useAuth.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具函数</td>\n<td>camelCase</td>\n<td><code>formatDate.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常量文件</td>\n<td>camelCase</td>\n<td><code>constants.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型文件</td>\n<td>camelCase</td>\n<td><code>types.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试文件</td>\n<td>同源文件 + <code>.test</code></td>\n<td><code>Button.test.tsx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storybook</td>\n<td>同源文件 + <code>.stories</code></td>\n<td><code>Button.stories.tsx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录名</td>\n<td>kebab-case</td>\n<td><code>user-profile/</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"路径别名\">路径别名</h2><p>通过 TypeScript 路径别名避免冗长的相对路径，提升代码可读性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;baseUrl&quot;: &quot;.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paths&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;@/*&quot;: [&quot;./src/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@/features/*&quot;: [&quot;./src/features/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@/shared/*&quot;: [&quot;./src/shared/*&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"baseUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@/features/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/features/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@/shared/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/shared/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 没有别名&#10;import { Button } from &#39;../../../shared/components/Button&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 使用别名&#10;import { Button } from &#39;@/shared/components/Button&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 没有别名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '../../../shared/components/Button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用别名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/shared/components/Button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"next-js-app-router-目录约定\">Next.js App Router 目录约定</h2><p>Next.js App Router 采用文件系统路由，目录结构即路由结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/&#10;├── layout.tsx                  # 根布局&#10;├── page.tsx                    # 首页 /&#10;├── loading.tsx                 # 全局加载 UI&#10;├── error.tsx                   # 全局错误 UI&#10;├── not-found.tsx               # 404 页面&#10;├── (marketing)/                # 路由组（不影响 URL）&#10;│   ├── about/&#10;│   │   └── page.tsx            # /about&#10;│   └── pricing/&#10;│       └── page.tsx            # /pricing&#10;├── (dashboard)/                # 路由组&#10;│   ├── layout.tsx              # 仪表盘布局&#10;│   ├── overview/&#10;│   │   └── page.tsx            # /overview&#10;│   └── settings/&#10;│       └── page.tsx            # /settings&#10;└── api/                        # API 路由&#10;    └── users/&#10;        └── route.ts            # /api/users\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── layout.tsx                  # 根布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── page.tsx                    # 首页 /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── loading.tsx                 # 全局加载 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── error.tsx                   # 全局错误 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── not-found.tsx               # 404 页面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── (marketing)/                # 路由组（不影响 URL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── about/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── page.tsx            # /about</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── pricing/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── page.tsx            # /pricing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── (dashboard)/                # 路由组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── layout.tsx              # 仪表盘布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── overview/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── page.tsx            # /overview</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── settings/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── page.tsx            # /settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── api/                        # API 路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── users/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── route.ts            # /api/users</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ROOT[&quot;app/layout.tsx&lt;br/&gt;根布局&quot;]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; MARKETING[&quot;(marketing)&lt;br/&gt;营销页面组&quot;]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; DASHBOARD[&quot;(dashboard)&lt;br/&gt;仪表盘页面组&quot;]&#10;    MARKETING --&gt; ABOUT[&quot;about/page.tsx&quot;]&#10;    MARKETING --&gt; PRICING[&quot;pricing/page.tsx&quot;]&#10;    DASHBOARD --&gt; DL[&quot;layout.tsx&lt;br/&gt;仪表盘布局&quot;]&#10;    DL --&gt; OVERVIEW[&quot;overview/page.tsx&quot;]&#10;    DL --&gt; SETTINGS[&quot;settings/page.tsx&quot;]\">graph TD\n    ROOT[\"app/layout.tsx&lt;br/&gt;根布局\"]\n    ROOT --&gt; MARKETING[\"(marketing)&lt;br/&gt;营销页面组\"]\n    ROOT --&gt; DASHBOARD[\"(dashboard)&lt;br/&gt;仪表盘页面组\"]\n    MARKETING --&gt; ABOUT[\"about/page.tsx\"]\n    MARKETING --&gt; PRICING[\"pricing/page.tsx\"]\n    DASHBOARD --&gt; DL[\"layout.tsx&lt;br/&gt;仪表盘布局\"]\n    DL --&gt; OVERVIEW[\"overview/page.tsx\"]\n    DL --&gt; SETTINGS[\"settings/page.tsx\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Feature-Based 目录结构以业务功能为维度组织代码，是大中型项目的推荐方案。</li>\n<li>依赖方向规则确保 features 之间的隔离，通过 shared 层实现代码共享。</li>\n<li>Barrel File 明确模块的公开 API，隐藏内部实现。</li>\n<li>一致的命名约定和路径别名提升代码的可读性和可维护性。</li>\n<li>框架特定的目录约定（如 Next.js App Router）应当与 Feature-Based 结构有机结合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"目录约定","id":"目录约定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"应用层目录结构","id":"应用层目录结构"},{"level":3,"text":"Feature-Based 结构（推荐）","id":"feature-based-结构-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖方向规则","id":"依赖方向规则"},{"level":2,"text":"Barrel File 模式","id":"barrel-file-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"组件文件组织","id":"组件文件组织"},{"level":3,"text":"单文件组件","id":"单文件组件"},{"level":3,"text":"组件目录","id":"组件目录"},{"level":2,"text":"命名约定","id":"命名约定"},{"level":2,"text":"路径别名","id":"路径别名"},{"level":2,"text":"Next.js App Router 目录约定","id":"next-js-app-router-目录约定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"框架选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/framework-selection"},"next":{"title":"ESLint 与 Biome","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/eslint-and-biome"}}